From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chris <meischris39@hotmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 22:30:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Disable patched romsets by default

RetroAchievements doesn't allow patched romsets in hardcore mode. The
add-on has no settings to turn the option off, so by default no game
could be played in hardcore.
---
 src/burner/libretro/retro_common.cpp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/burner/libretro/retro_common.cpp b/src/burner/libretro/retro_common.cpp
index 305aab6..cd62ac9 100644
--- a/src/burner/libretro/retro_common.cpp
+++ b/src/burner/libretro/retro_common.cpp
@@ -269,7 +269,7 @@ static struct retro_core_option_v2_definition var_fbneo_allow_patched_romsets =
 		{ "enabled",  NULL },
 		{ NULL,       NULL },
 	},
-	"enabled"
+	"disabled"
 };
 static struct retro_core_option_v2_definition var_fbneo_samplerate = {
 	"fbneo-samplerate",
-- 
2.53.0

